<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Kiden Kogyo to be listed on TSE on Feb 24.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Kiden Kogyo to be listed on TSE on Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Thursday that Hitachi Kiden Kogyo Ltd will be listed on the second section of the TSE.</p>
<p>One million shares of the Hitachi Kiden will be listed on February 24, TSE said.</p>
<p>The shares were initially listed on the second section of the Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) in April 1970.</p>
